{"title":"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nonzero real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/e/0fe3a37f5fe3f8aad2edd000f2343531ee2355bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/d/01d0054e2461687d07444e337ee9107222d31a53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y &lt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. How many of the following inequalities must be true?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/3979ca0bae618be8e543774fbf7e4483f60948b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(I)}\\ x+y &lt; a+b\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa1f624a04f0f4a5bf4e976cfc7780f27a96a125.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(II)}\\ x-y &lt; a-b\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/7/ca79e6a370455b3ef3b5e4439109768e1a03d8db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(III)}\\ xy &lt; ab\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/a/eba4db5565f310d94d209a8bb35a12a78bc9c0d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(IV)}\\ \\frac{x}{y} &lt; \\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"92\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3ad07ba45d9a4dcd46fbd971320abb2585f7ce0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/b/b2b66c8a518bad923856228dfe8c2d44f3a8ca09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = x + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6da5c768d3e309c1b5337c06bf5ad8df078c5c01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/2/952cdef63dd674cdb4e441bd818e562c9a96d8a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = y + l$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b6929b93575e7fdc389f2cd99c122cad452a7571.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />. We can write that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd77a438af192a0e9509583e6f84ff440f50ec3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y &lt; x + y + k + l \\implies x + y &lt; a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"326\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>It is important to note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> counterexample fully disproves a claim. Let's try substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/3/9e395764b968db4cf5790b3cf4062cf0c9423046.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-3,y=-4,a=1,b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"225\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a541108812474a0d3781782db95e6ad6579759c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(II)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" /> states that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0ab2484fb0470e12ca615c9b061a5e921abe2973.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y&lt;a-b \\implies -3 - (-4) &lt; 1 - 4  \\implies 1 &lt; -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"411\" height=\"20\" />.Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a541108812474a0d3781782db95e6ad6579759c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(II)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" /> is false.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc362d4a78df9648fcc75f63332e87bc916b42a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(III)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"17\" /> states that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/6/7163cd85e54fd9a407a188de702a01e2b13e1e2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy&lt;ab \\implies (-3) \\cdot (-4) &lt; 1 \\cdot 4 \\implies 12 &lt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"357\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc362d4a78df9648fcc75f63332e87bc916b42a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(III)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"17\" /> is false.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/5/ba5fa1cae0968ba1ff4bce7f4954c2a3cdcc09c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(IV)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"17\" /> states that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/6/eb6cdb8a6f722bd7613aad3024b5b6c9482027de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}&lt;\\frac{a}{b} \\implies \\frac{-3}{-4} &lt; \\frac{1}{4} \\implies 0.75 &lt; 0.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"306\" height=\"42\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/5/ba5fa1cae0968ba1ff4bce7f4954c2a3cdcc09c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(IV)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"17\" /> is false.\n</p><p><br />\nOne of our four inequalities is true, hence, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/78239690c6863df7c4c76cb7408bfb720373cb62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) 1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~MathFun1000\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0QeqCeojr6Q\">https://youtu.be/0QeqCeojr6Q</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A\">2014 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b